---
import SiteLayout from "../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
---
<SiteLayout title="Work With Us | Materuni Hosts" description="Work with local hosts in Materuni Village. Connect with Materuni Hosts about guiding, hospitality, community experiences and responsible tourism opportunities.">
<section class="page-hero">
 <span class="eyebrow">GROW WITH OUR COMMUNITY</span>
 <h1>Work with us in Materuni.</h1>
 <p>We believe the best guest experiences begin with people who know this place, care for its culture and enjoy welcoming others. If that sounds like you, we would love to hear from you.</p>
</section>
<section class="section">
 <div class="split">
  <div>
   <span class="eyebrow">LOCAL PEOPLE · SHARED STORIES</span>
   <h2>Bring your skills. Share your home.</h2>
   <p>We welcome conversations with local guides, cooks, hosts, artists, storytellers, drivers and responsible tourism partners who want to create thoughtful experiences in Materuni.</p>
   <div class="feature-list">
    <div><strong>Local knowledge</strong>Help guests understand Materuni through real stories, traditions and everyday life.</div>
    <div><strong>Hospitality</strong>Make visitors feel welcome through thoughtful, friendly service.</div>
    <div><strong>Care for place</strong>Support respectful tourism that values local culture and the natural environment.</div>
   </div>
  </div>
  <div class="booking-panel">
   <span class="eyebrow">START A CONVERSATION</span>
   <h2>Tell us about yourself.</h2>
   <p>Send a short introduction, the kind of work you are interested in, your experience and your availability. We will get back to you when a suitable opportunity is available.</p>
   <div class="actions">
    <a class="button" href="mailto:hello@materunihosts.com?subject=Working%20with%20Materuni%20Hosts">Email our team</a>
    <a class="button button-secondary" href="https://wa.me/255612068540?text=Hello%20Materuni%20Hosts%2C%20I%27m%20interested%20in%20working%20with%20you." target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Message on WhatsApp</a>
   </div>
   <p class="muted">Please note: this is an expression of interest, not a job vacancy or guarantee of employment.</p>
  </div>
 </div>
</section>
</SiteLayout>
